# 统一换行符处理，避免 Windows/Mac/Linux 协作时整个文件显示为已修改
# 仓库内部一律用 LF 存储，检出时按平台转换

* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确指定文本类型
*.py    text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.csv   text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.txt   text eol=lf
*.toml  text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须保持 CRLF，否则 cmd 可能解析异常
*.bat   text eol=crlf
*.cmd   text eol=crlf
*.ps1   text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做任何转换
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.pt    binary
*.pth   binary
*.onnx  binary
*.npz   binary
*.zip   binary
*.jar   binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks   binary
